3.18.1 Configuration 1: The Default Experience
----------------------------------------------

     (require 'fuzzy-clock)
     (setq fuzzy-clock-fuzziness 'hour)
     (setq fuzzy-clock-update-interval 60)
     (fuzzy-clock-mode 1)

   This is the recommended starting point.  Hour-level fuzziness,
updates every minute.


